    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im having a really weird headache all of a sudden... it came on like a lightning bolt. i also noticed my face looks kinda wonky in the mirror like the left side is drooping a bit and my words are coming out all mushy and thick. is this just like a really bad migraine aura or something??",
